        "boundary": "<p>That is what tradition describes. It is not the same as modern clinical proof, and we will not pretend it is. We keep tradition and evidence separate on purpose — and where we cannot yet point to strong evidence, we would rather say nothing than overstate. That restraint is the honest version of an Ayurvedic ritual, and we think it is the only one worth making.</p>",
